---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Projects
description: Open-source tools by Jian — static APIs, data visualisation, and test automation.
permalink: /projects/
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="page-title">Projects</h1>
  <p class="lede">Small, self-contained tools I maintain. Most of them exist because I wanted the thing to exist.</p>
</section>

<p class="atlas-legend">
  <span><b>{{ projects | length }}</b> objects</span>
  <span>magnitude = stars</span>
</p>

<section class="project-grid">
  {% for project in projects %}
  {% set stars = project.meta.split('★')[0] | int %}
  <a class="project" href="{{ project.url }}" style="--mag: {{ stars }}; --mag-tint: {% if stars >= 30 %}var(--accent){% elif stars >= 10 %}var(--star-cool){% else %}var(--star-faint){% endif %}">
    <h2>{{ project.title }}</h2>
    <p>{{ project.blurb }}</p>
    <span class="post-meta">{{ project.meta }}</span>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
